---
permalink: /search-faq.json
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- The bank that search matches a reader's QUESTION against.

    Two kinds of entry, same shape, so one matcher covers the whole site:
      - every FAQ answer, deep-linked to the single question (faq.njk expands it on arrival)
      - every PUBLISHED blog post, matched on its title + description

    Posts matter here: without them the smart question-matching tier only ever reaches the FAQ, and a
    site's 200 posts stay reachable only by single-word matching. `collections.posts` is already
    date-gated, so future drip posts stay out until they publish. Fetched lazily, only when a search
    finds no exact hit. -#}
[
{%- for g in faqs.groups %}{% for item in g.items %}
{"q":{{ item.q | dump | safe }},"a":{{ item.a | truncate(160) | dump | safe }},"url":{{ ("/faq/#q-" + g.id + "-" + loop.index) | url | dump | safe }},"topic":{{ g.category | dump | safe }}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- if collections.posts.length %},
{%- for post in collections.posts %}
{"q":{{ post.data.title | dump | safe }},"a":{{ (post.data.pageDescription or "") | truncate(160) | dump | safe }},"url":{{ post.url | url | dump | safe }},"topic":"From the blog"}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
]
